    "detailed_description": "Energy Tail is an oldschool arcade game where you fight enemies in relentless arena battles. You take control over a blue vectoid, which tries to stop the invasion of enemy vectoids into its realm. To defeat its enemies, the blue vectoid is able to create a deadly tail while moving, allowing it to let the enemies crash into its tail. However, the same is true for the enemy vectoids.<br>The tron-inspired mechanic is simple to learn and hard to master, allowing for fast-paced arcade action that demands precision as well as quick reactions.<br>Can you seal the breaches and stop the invasion?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced arcade action that requires quick reactions and high precision<br></li><li>Simple game mechanics that are easy to learn and hard to master<br></li><li>An abstract realm with elegant graphics<br></li><li>3 hand-crafted difficulty levels<br></li><li>The hard difficulty poses a real challenge<br></li><li>20 levels offering a variety of enemy types<br></li><li>Endless mode</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Energy Tail is an oldschool arcade game where you fight enemies in relentless arena battles. You take control over a blue vectoid, which tries to stop the invasion of enemy vectoids into its realm. To defeat its enemies, the blue vectoid is able to create a deadly tail while moving, allowing it to let the enemies crash into its tail. However, the same is true for the enemy vectoids.<br>The tron-inspired mechanic is simple to learn and hard to master, allowing for fast-paced arcade action that demands precision as well as quick reactions.<br>Can you seal the breaches and stop the invasion?<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced arcade action that requires quick reactions and high precision<br></li><li>Simple game mechanics that are easy to learn and hard to master<br></li><li>An abstract realm with elegant graphics<br></li><li>3 hand-crafted difficulty levels<br></li><li>The hard difficulty poses a real challenge<br></li><li>20 levels offering a variety of enemy types<br></li><li>Endless mode</li></ul>",
